<h1 class="uk-heading-line uk-margin">
        <span>    
        
                    Board of Directors Elections        
        
        </span>    
</h1><div class="uk-panel uk-margin"><p>At the February 11, 2020 Board of Director’s meeting, the Board voted to change the Coastside County Water District’s electoral system for members of the Board of Directors from at-large to zone elections beginning with the November 3, 2020 election. The District now uses a system based on five zones and has established zone boundaries and sequencing of the elections. Instead of voting for each available open seat on the Board of Directors, you will now vote only for the candidates running within your zone.</p></div>
<div class="uk-card uk-card-default uk-card-body uk-margin-remove-first-child uk-margin-remove-top uk-margin-bottom" id="map">
    
        
            
                
            
            
                                                
                
                    

        
        
        
    
        
        
                <div class="el-content uk-panel uk-margin-top"><h3><b>Find Your Electoral Zone</b></h3>
<p>On February 8, 2022, at the Regular Board Meeting, the Board of Directors voted to approve the adjusted zone-based boundary map for election of members of the Board of Directors based on 2020 census data for redistricting. See below for the approved map of the District’s 5 electoral zones.</p>
<p><a class="uk-text-large" href="https://redistrictingpartners.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Coastside-Water-District-Final-Approved-Plan.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Final Approved Interactive Map</span> <span uk-icon="link-external"></span></strong></a><br />Click the map link above, then type your full address including city (El Granada, Princeton-by-the-Sea, Half Moon Bay) in the search box located at the top right of the map. A map marker will appear indicating your address location, and you may zoom in/out as needed.</p>
<p style="line-height: 2;"><strong>MAP COLOR KEY:<br /></strong><strong><span style="color: #b85c00;">Zone 1 (orange)</span></strong> – David Dickson<br /><strong><span style="color: green;">Zone 2 (green)</span></strong> – Chris Mickelsen<br /><strong><span class="uk-text-danger">Zone 3 (red) </span></strong> &#8211; Ken Coverdell<br /><strong><span style="color: purple;">Zone 4 (purple)</span></strong> – John Muller<br /><strong><span style="color: brown;">Zone 5 (brown)</span></strong> – Robert Feldman</p></div>        
        
        

                
                
            
        
    
</div><div class="uk-panel uk-margin"><p>Elections will be held in zones 1, 2 and 5 in 2026. Future Elections in zones 1, 3 and 4 will be held in 2028.</p></div>
                
            
        
    
</div>
<div class="js-sticky uk-width-medium@m">
    
        
            
            
            
                                <div class="uk-panel uk-position-z-index" uk-sticky="end: !.js-sticky; media: @m;">                
                    
<div>    
<div class="uk-grid uk-child-width-1-1" uk-grid>    <div>
<div class="uk-panel widget widget_text" id="text-4">

    
    			<div class="uk-panel textwidget"><p><a aria-label="Pay bill online" class="uk-button uk-button-secondary uk-width-1-1" href="https://www.municipalonlinepayments.com/coastsidecountywaterdistrict/utilities" target="_blank" rel="noopener" > Pay Bill Online</a></p>
</div>
		
</div>
</div>    <div>
<div class="uk-panel widget widget_nav_menu" id="nav_menu-12">

    
